OL,3,GNEWSAPrince Charles cinema saved from
OL,4,Apotential closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FVaq Farooq, CEO of Criterion Capital,
OL,7,Fsaid he was pleased to reach an
OL,8,Fequitable solution for all, and said:
OL,9,F"A 25-year commitment provides real
OL,10,Fsecurity for the cinema and its fans,
OL,11,Fand we are delighted to be continuing
OL,12,Four partnership for many years to
OL,13,Fcome."
